//! The gateway proxies `/api/v1/{domain}/*` to the domain workers over
//! service bindings; the integration catalog/installations API (issue #521)
//! is the one DB-backed platform surface it serves directly. AppState
//! carries exactly what the shared worker auth middleware needs: a
//! cornucopia client source, the JWT secret, and the Supabase URL.

